{
  "assessment": "Independent family source-closure review against the frozen arXiv TeX confirms the complete submitted quantum-control-threshold family. Frozen-source lines 130-158 define the inverted-harmonic-oscillator squeezing channel S_kappa, the ancilla measurement-and-reset attenuation channel C_gamma, and their stochastic mixture T=(1-p)S_kappa+p C_gamma; lines 139-151 bind kappa and gamma to the two channel strengths, consistently with their positive-domain statement at line 74. Lines 247-262 derive lambda_n=(1-p)exp(n kappa)+p exp(-n gamma), the exact threshold p_n^*=(exp(n kappa)-1)/(exp(n kappa)-exp(-n gamma)) for every n>0, and p_(n+1)^*>p_n^*. The historical n=1 and alternate n=2 branches therefore share the same source-defined channel, public controls/readout, applicability domain, and exact expression skeleton, differing only in the private operator order. The public [0.02,0.42]^2 domain is a conservative finite subset of kappa,gamma>0 and is not represented as an experimental acquisition range. Independent execution on a 401 by 401 grid (160,801 points per branch) matched a separately evaluated source formula to maximum absolute discrepancies 2.55351295663786e-15 for n=1 and 1.2212453270876722e-15 for n=2, with finite probabilities in [0.055627395233796104,0.9710746454855945]. Both branches were strictly increasing in kappa and strictly decreasing in gamma on every complete grid row/column; p_2^*-p_1^* stayed positive with minimum sampled separation 0.004998833539966552. Every diagnostic/hidden prediction was exact at stored precision and ten repeated identical queries per branch were bit-identical. The newly added common IHO-channel condition fixes the former applicability overreach without exposing n or the threshold formula. Serialized Player definitions are identical across worlds within each track after normalizing the opaque instance ID; branch-specific n conditions and selector parameters remain Oracle-only. Exact known-truth submissions pass historical/counterfactual by Identification/Discovery with zero hidden-test scaled error. No unresolved source, formula, applicability, domain, direction, information-boundary, prediction, determinism, or four-cell issue remains.",
